For n=1, the matrix $ B $ is 2x2, skew-symmetric, so it has the form: $$
B = \begin{pmatrix}
0 & X \\
-Y & 0
\end{pmatrix}
$$

These correspond to A entries: - B_{1,2} depends on A_{1,2}, A_{2,1}
- B_{1,3} depends on A_{1,3}, A_{3,1}
- B_{2,4} depends on A_{2,4}, A_{4,2}
- B_{3,4} depends on A_{3,4}, A_{4,3}

